# ^Name
Name
# ^Completed
"已完成 / Completed"
# ^LicenseText
"请在安装 $(^NameDA) 之前阅读许可证协议。如果你接受协议中所有条款，点击 [我同意(I)] 。 / Please review the license agreement before installing $(^NameDA). If you accept all terms of the agreement, click I Agree."
# ^LicenseTextCB
"请在安装 $(^NameDA) 之前阅读许可证协议。如果你接受协议中所有条款，点击下方的选框。 $_CLICK / Please review the license agreement before installing $(^NameDA). If you accept all terms of the agreement, click the check box below. $_CLICK"
# ^LicenseTextRB
"请在安装 $(^NameDA) 之前阅读许可证协议。如果你接受协议中所有条款，选择下方的第一个选项。 $_CLICK / Please review the license agreement before installing $(^NameDA). If you accept all terms of the agreement, select the first option below. $_CLICK"
# ^UnLicenseText
"请在卸载 $(^NameDA) 之前阅读许可证协议。如果你接受协议中所有条款，点击 [我同意(I)] 。 / Please review the license agreement before uninstalling $(^NameDA). If you accept all terms of the agreement, click I Agree."
# ^UnLicenseTextCB
"请在卸载 $(^NameDA) 之前阅读许可证协议。如果你接受协议中所有条款，点击下方的选框。 $_CLICK / Please review the license agreement before uninstalling $(^NameDA). If you accept all terms of the agreement, click the check box below. $_CLICK"
# ^UnLicenseTextRB
"请在卸载 $(^NameDA) 之前阅读许可证协议。如果你接受协议中所有条款，选择下方的第一个选项。 $_CLICK / Please review the license agreement before uninstalling $(^NameDA). If you accept all terms of the agreement, select the first option below. $_CLICK"
# ^Custom
"自定义 / Custom"
# ^ComponentsText
"请勾选你想安装的组件，并取消勾选你不想安装的组件。 $_CLICK / Check the components you want to install and uncheck the components you don't want to install. $_CLICK"
# ^ComponentsSubText1
"选定的安装的类型:  / Select the type of install:"
# ^ComponentsSubText2_NoInstTypes
"选定安装的组件:  / Select components to install:"
# ^ComponentsSubText2
"或者，自定义选定想安装的组件:  / Or, select the optional components you wish to install:"
# ^UnComponentsText
"请勾选你想卸载的组件，并取消勾选你不想卸载的组件。 $_CLICK / Check the components you want to uninstall and uncheck the components you don't want to uninstall. $_CLICK"
# ^UnComponentsSubText1
"选择卸载的类型:  / Select the type of uninstall:"
# ^UnComponentsSubText2_NoInstTypes
"选择要卸载的组件:  / Select components to uninstall:"
# ^UnComponentsSubText2
"或是，选择想要解除安装的可选项组件:  / Or, select the optional components you wish to uninstall:"
