# ^FileError
"无法打开要写入的文件: \r\n\t"$0"\r\n点击 [Abort] 停止安装，\r\n [Retry] 重新尝试写入文件，或者\r\n [Ignore] 忽略这个文件。 / Error opening file for writing: \r\n\r\n$0\r\n\r\nClick Abort to stop the installation,\r\nRetry to try again, or\r\nIgnore to skip this file."
# ^FileError_NoIgnore
"无法打开要写入的文件: \r\n\t"$0"\r\n点击 [Retry] 重新尝试写入文件，或者\r\n [Cancel] 停止安装。 / Error opening file for writing: \r\n\r\n$0\r\n\r\nClick Retry to try again, or\r\nCancel to stop the installation."
